                    <p> VEX Robotics has been the most significant influence in my decision to pursue engineering. As a member of 
                    Team 687B Nerd Herd, I gained my first exposure to a STEM curriculum. Starting on the mechanical 
                    team, I learned the engineering design process, used CAD software like Fusion 360, 
                    and honed my skills in mechanical assembly. </p>
                    <p> Over time, I was promoted to team captain, where I co-led a group of 12 members. Together with my 
                    co-captain, I organized team meetings, tracked participation, and drove continuous improvements in our designs and 
                    code to compete at a high level. </p>

