                    but I'd say utilized Astro and Tailwind CSS to a successful degree. The source code is linked 
                    <a id="github-repo" href="https://github.com/Reaper3629/Reaper3629.github.io">here</a> and below, and I do recommend 
                    people try making their own websites. It gives you a better idea of how other websites are structured and provides a 
                    platform to constantly iterate on and watch develop. As of writing this, I know it's a bit simplistic, but I am excited to 
